      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Trenton''' is a city located in [[Gibson County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 4,683.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Gibson County, Tennessee|Gibson County]]{{GR|6}}.

