      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Tusculum''' is a city located in [[Greene County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,004.  It is the home of [[Tusculum College]], the oldest university in [[Tennessee]] and the 28th oldest in the United States.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TNMap-doton-Tusculum.PNG|right|Location of Tusculum, Tennessee]]
Tusculum is located at 36&amp;deg;10'33&quot; North, 82&amp;deg;45'3&quot; West (36.175697, -82.750728){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 11.7 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (4.5 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  11.7 km&amp;sup2; (4.5 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of the area is covered with water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 2,004 people, 590 households, and 437 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 171.9/km&amp;sup2; (445.4/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 620 housing units at an average density of 53.2/km&amp;sup2; (137.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 95.41% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 3.64% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.05% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.50% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.05% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.35% from two or more races.  0.30% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 590 households out of which 24.4% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 64.4% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 7.3% have a female householder with no husband present, and 25.8% are non-families. 23.1% of all households are made up of individuals and 9.2% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.28 and the average family size is 2.66.

In the city the population is spread out with 12.7% under the age of 18, 18.3% from 18 to 24, 25.4% from 25 to 44, 28.8% from 45 to 64, and 14.9% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 41 years.  For every 100 females there are 106.2 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 104.2 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $37,460, and the median income for a family is $50,074. Males have a median income of $31,607 versus $23,594 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $15,834.  6.1% of the population and 5.8% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 3.4% of those under the age of 18 and 9.0% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

