      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Hickory Valley''' is a town located in [[Hardeman County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 136.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TNMap-doton-HickoryValley.PNG|right|Location of Hickory Valley, Tennessee]]
Hickory Valley is located at 35&amp;deg;9'18&quot; North, 89&amp;deg;7'36&quot; West (35.154873, -89.126577){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the town has a total area of 0.8 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (0.3 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  0.8 km&amp;sup2; (0.3 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of the area is covered with water.

