      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Gainesboro''' is a town located in [[Jackson County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 879.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Jackson County, Tennessee|Jackson County]]{{GR|6}}.

