*Cumberland Avenue, also known as &quot;the Strip&quot; ([[US 11]]/[[US 70]];[[Tennessee State Route 1|TN 1]])
*[[Emory Road (Knoxville)|Emory Road]], formerly a wilderness trail for settlers, now part of [[Tennessee State Route 131|TN 131]]
