== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,660 people, 727 households, and 482 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 193.1/km&amp;sup2; (500.1/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 786 housing units at an average density of 91.4/km&amp;sup2; (236.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 97.35% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 2.17% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.00% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.00% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.30% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.18% from two or more races.  0.60% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

