In the city the population is spread out with 20.0% under the age of 18, 9.9% from 18 to 24, 26.3% from 25 to 44, 26.4% from 45 to 64, and 17.5% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 41 years.  For every 100 females there are 84.2 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 78.5 males.

