      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Finger''' is a city located in [[McNairy County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 350.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TNMap-doton-Finger.PNG|right|Location of Finger, Tennessee]]
