      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Tellico Plains''' is a town located in [[Monroe County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 859.

== Geography ==
Tellico Plains is located at 35&amp;deg;21'60&quot; North, 84&amp;deg;17'56&quot; West (35.366575, -84.298955){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the town has a total area of 4.0 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (1.6 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  4.0 km&amp;sup2; (1.6 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of the area is covered with water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 859 people, 393 households, and 227 families residing in the town.  The [[population density]] is 212.6/km&amp;sup2; (549.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 446 housing units at an average density of 110.4/km&amp;sup2; (285.5/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the town is 96.74% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.00% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.81% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.81% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.12% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.51% from two or more races.  1.75% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 393 households out of which 27.7% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 41.5% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 12.7% have a female householder with no husband present, and 42.2% are non-families. 39.7% of all households are made up of individuals and 17.3% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.19 and the average family size is 2.92.

In the town the population is spread out with 22.9% under the age of 18, 8.5% from 18 to 24, 26.7% from 25 to 44, 26.9% from 45 to 64, and 15.0% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 39 years.  For every 100 females there are 95.2 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 91.9 males.

The median income for a household in the town is $18,750, and the median income for a family is $31,087. Males have a median income of $27,045 versus $18,333 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the town is $13,234.  24.4% of the population and 19.2% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 25.2% of those under the age of 18 and 38.9% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

== External links ==
