      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Wartburg''' is a city located in [[Morgan County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 890.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Morgan County, Tennessee|Morgan County]]{{GR|6}}.

