      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Byrdstown''' is a town located in [[Pickett County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 903.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Pickett County, Tennessee|Pickett County]]{{GR|6}}.
