      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Benton''' is a town located in [[Polk County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 1,138.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Polk County, Tennessee|Polk County]]{{GR|6}}.

