      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Baxter''' is a town located in [[Putnam County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 1,279.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TNMap-doton-Baxter.PNG|right|Location of Baxter, Tennessee]]
