      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Springfield''' is a city located in [[Robertson County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 14,329.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Robertson County, Tennessee|Robertson County]]{{GR|6}}.

