      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Huntsville''' is a town located in [[Scott County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 981.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Scott County, Tennessee|Scott County]]{{GR|6}}.

