      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Luttrell''' is a town located in [[Union County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 915.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TNMap-doton-Luttrell.PNG|right|Location of Luttrell, Tennessee]]
Luttrell is located at 36&amp;deg;12'11&quot; North, 83&amp;deg;44'45&quot; West (36.203097, -83.745867){{GR|1}}. Luttrell is home of country singers [[Kenny Chesney]] and [[Roy Acuff]].

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the town has a total area of 10.2 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (3.9 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  10.2 km&amp;sup2; (3.9 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of the area is covered with water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 915 people, 352 households, and 273 families residing in the town.  The [[population density]] is 89.9/km&amp;sup2; (232.7/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 382 housing units at an average density of 37.5/km&amp;sup2; (97.1/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the town is 98.80% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.33% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.44% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.00% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.00% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.44% from two or more races.  0.77% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 352 households out of which 34.1% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 61.9% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 11.6% have a female householder with no husband present, and 22.4% are non-families. 20.7% of all households are made up of individuals and 9.7% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.55 and the average family size is 2.93.

In the town the population is spread out with 25.4% under the age of 18, 8.5% from 18 to 24, 29.3% from 25 to 44, 23.3% from 45 to 64, and 13.6% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 37 years.  For every 100 females there are 94.7 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 90.3 males.

The median income for a household in the town is $20,766, and the median income for a family is $22,875. Males have a median income of $23,269 versus $17,438 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the town is $10,203.  26.3% of the population and 22.3% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 35.0% of those under the age of 18 and 37.6% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

==Famous residents==
* [[Kenny Chesney]], country music artist
* [[Chet Atkins]], country music artist

