      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Waynesboro''' is a city located in [[Wayne County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,228.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Wayne County, Tennessee|Wayne County]]{{GR|6}}.

Country singer [[Mark Collie]] was born in Waynesboro.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TNMap-doton-Waynesboro.PNG|right|Location of Waynesboro, Tennessee]]
