      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Dresden''' is a town located in [[Weakley County, Tennessee]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 2,855.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Weakley County, Tennessee|Weakley County]]{{GR|6}}.

