      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Diboll''' is a city located in [[Angelina County, Texas]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 5,470. Diboll is named for [[J. C. Diboll]], a local timber salesman.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TXMap-doton-Diboll.PNG|right|Location of Diboll, Texas]]
