      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Hudson''' is a city located in [[Angelina County, Texas]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 3,792.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TXMap-doton-Hudson.PNG|right|Location of Hudson, Texas]]
