      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Charlotte''' is a city located in [[Atascosa County, Texas]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,637. The town is named for [[Charlotte Simmons]], the daughter of Dr. [[Charles Simmons]], who aided in the development of Atascosa County. 

