      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Poteet''' is a city in [[Atascosa County, Texas]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 3,305.

== Geography ==
[[Image:TXMap-doton-Poteet.PNG|right|Location of Poteet, Texas]]
Poteet is located at 29&amp;deg;2'23&quot; North, 98&amp;deg;34'27&quot; West (29.039751, -98.574292){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 3.9 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (1.5 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  3.9 km&amp;sup2; (1.5 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of the area is covered with water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 3,305 people, 1,052 households, and 810 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 856.4/km&amp;sup2; (2,224.2/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 1,201 housing units at an average density of 311.2/km&amp;sup2; (808.2/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 64.99% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.36% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.27% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.00% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 30.11% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 4.27% from two or more races.  88.84% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 1,052 households out of which 44.3% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 47.1% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 23.7% have a female householder with no husband present, and 23.0% are non-families. 21.0% of all households are made up of individuals and 11.8% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 3.11 and the average family size is 3.60.

In the city the population is spread out with 34.6% under the age of 18, 10.2% from 18 to 24, 25.6% from 25 to 44, 17.7% from 45 to 64, and 12.0% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 29 years.  For every 100 females there are 90.8 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 83.5 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $25,329, and the median income for a family is $27,949. Males have a median income of $23,929 versus $15,608 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $9,368.  28.0% of the population and 23.6% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 33.1% of those under the age of 18 and 29.7% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

== External links ==
